@startuml
!theme plain
|a_default| Default
|a_default|
start
:To start the process for ACME;
:begin with the New Resupply Cycle;
:Check Levels of Inventory;
:v1: Inventory Level ({inventory is below or equal to the minimum, inventory is greater than the minimum}); <<objectSignal>>
if () then ([v1 = 'inventory is below or equal to the minimum'])
:generate an Equal to or below minimum Report;
:create Purchase Orders (POs);
repeat :;
:If the PO is created, it needs to be reviewed. If the PO needs to be reworked, it needs to be created again.;
:v2: PO Status ({PO is rejected, PO is approved}); <<objectSignal>>
backward:it needs to be reworked;
repeat while () is ([v2 = 'PO is rejected']) not ([v2 = 'PO is approved'])
:it is printed and released in the system;
split
:reserve funds for the released POs;
:receive the Packing Slip;
split again
:mail the POs to the supplier;
:receive the inventory;
end split
:receive the Invoice;
:proceed to the Three-way match;
:release the funds;
:issue the payment;
:the Resupply Cycle is complete and the process ends;
stop
else ([v1 = 'inventory is greater than the minimum'])
:generate an Above Minimum Report;
stop
endif
@enduml